scape w OC2.png", "id": "681785296602984", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572942_681785299936317_6195079646150526172_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aBudTizcbcgQ7kNvwHH3-JE&_nc_oc=AdlK4nk5QJoqMqddk274-SU0XL3b1uGp6fePOJqQGJPAsk5R1xAFikzYLCJCmEuYX6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvELsb3tZSQxhkqxmZwFb0-5RFSULsjicyEuo0LAr7_ng&oe=699AEA7F"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape w OC4.png", "id": "824666655475703", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035442_824666658809036_6710717846128327238_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DIcRsvggfPkQ7kNvwEha-Hq&_nc_oc=Adm_oUsLYtJTQVmJEN-hzlFW6OmAZAP_d7zomuTxAApUtNr8u-ZDSeEPVfaPxrBkZ40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIxKpDfagxKNsNLDNrqz8k6o1gt8SZJhTLvtxQ1z_kIw&oe=699B134C"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape w0012  cob.png", "id": "1559235387862587", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982440_1559235391195920_6496480092832263949_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JmxWR1rGBckQ7kNvwEDfixT&_nc_oc=AdmwOZIvGeSGk9ChA4JLFMxoz3iFgfyGAIZjApsQC-jKcmd5SrFjWGTK38k7rXNaaK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfufA9GBqurgcxMN9WV1ijl9fmJxZ6d_PWuuRd4WmgqWOQ&oe=699AEE81"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape w0012b.png", "id": "501823938670509", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_501823942003842_5107915751943572088_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=actMxHnvXf8Q7kNvwFgish7&_nc_oc=AdnDkg1np6KN4d_OBIJRxAZVvGJikY_TOEljKcGdFST8VPDQDB8gz4Y7J9PAmiqNpIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvC8AGoPOU8iyFbSKS49uQAsLVs6RWszg3oo9R3OqWH5w&oe=699B09B4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape ocean.png", "id": "426732919647217", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974740_426732922980550_2042688344430875991_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jPRQA4ZLnw8Q7kNvwFZPdD_&_nc_oc=AdllG6tGa1N5bhLL58KR2qZX-LutF4LnDWrsS-fpcD5sOtGWrG-fMNtsOu0cwmAEdLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv4ZWz5PjRN5CDCBqnKDuSfXVdRBO-gKBeV0L730ZuROQ&oe=699B015D"}, "display_name": "Ocean Passthrough", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience an ocean in your home!\n- over 100 hundred sea creatures and (updated) bonus level 50+ toy sized land animals/dinosaurs\n- August 2024 update: added object s position save state and custom mixed reality visual boundary to various areas and added a bonus jungle area\n- full Passthrough / Mixed Reality, Handtracking\n- move, delete, spawn animals to create your own ocean home! \n- turtles, sharks, whales, dolphins, clown fish, starfish, crocodiles, octopus, extinct dinosaur fish, piranha, and a wide variety of exotic and common sea creatures! + much more!\n-  bonus toy / table top land animals include:  rhino, elephant, t-rex, deer, crocodile, tiger, leopard, hippo, zebra, dogs, cats, various farms animals and dinosaurs, and more!\n- 10 scenes to explore, all with ability to spawn & delete fish and to move stationary fish:\n\u2014 feed swimming fish to a shark, feed fish to swimming sharks\n\u2014 swimming fish on random spawn\n\u2014 varying pre-made fish scenes\n\u2014 2 scenes full of turtles\n\u2014 empty scene to spawn fish\n\u2014 mammals only", "short_description": "Experience an ocean in your home!\n- 100+ hundred sea creatures, bonus level 50+ toy sized land animals/dinosaurs, bonus jungle \n- Passthrough, Handtracking\n- move, delete, spawn animals to create your own ocean home\n- turtles, sharks, whales, dolphins, octopus, extinct dinosaur fish, & a wide variety of exotic & common sea creatures +much more\n- 10 scenes to explore, all with ability to spawn and delete fish, including:\n\u2014 feed sharks\n\u2014 swimming fish on random spawn\n\u2014